      47.85,
      388.69,
      539.9,
      444.76
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, RaviKarunanayake, Minister of Finance, the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respect of listof commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the rates specified in thecorresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
